From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3drm: remaining gap-B items (3638)

d3drm: registry (GetNamedObject, EnumerateObjects, GetDevices, Tick), options and
clients, animation sets, shadows, user and clipped visuals, progressive meshes,
Load selection/sources/search path, frame and mesh builder Save (text and binary),
animation SetTime/key ids/ModifyKey/Clone, Clone of frame/mesh/wrap/texture/
viewport/device, mesh builder edit methods and sub meshes, wrap mapping, device
state/format/win callbacks, viewport DIRTYRECTS. See patches/notes/3638.txt.
---
diff --git a/dlls/d3drm/Makefile.in b/dlls/d3drm/Makefile.in
index 98736f8..67e6e12 100644
--- a/dlls/d3drm/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/d3drm/Makefile.in
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 MODULE    = d3drm.dll
 IMPORTLIB = d3drm
-IMPORTS   = d3dxof ddraw
+IMPORTS   = d3dxof ddraw gdi32
 
 EXTRADLLFLAGS = -Wb,--prefer-native
 
@@ -14,6 +14,8 @@ SOURCES = \
 	material.c \
 	math.c \
 	meshbuilder.c \
+	objects.c \
+	save.c \
 	render.c \
 	texture.c \
 	version.rc \
